BADBOY HOSPITAL

	A little forum for my friends :)

		=> http://hospital.badboy.institute

RUN YOUR OWN

	% cargo test
	% vim etc/cfg.toml
	% cargo run --bin new_board -- -b board_name -d description
	% cargo run --bin new_user -- -u username -p password
	% cargo run --bin new_admin -- -u username
	% cargo run --release

ADMINISTRATOR SCRIPTS

	These scripts manage the database. This forum is meant to be closed ac-
	cess, so to add users, make admins, add boards, etc, you must run these
	scripts.

	.______________________________________________________________________
	| cargo run --bin {}   | description                | options
	=----------------------=----------------------------=------------------
	] new_board            | creates a new board        | -b name -d desc
	] new_user             | creates a new user         | -u user -p pass
	] new_admin            | makes a user an admin      | -u user
	] rm_admin             | remove a user's admin privs| -u user
	] rm_user              | delete a user account      | -u user
	] set_pass             | set a user's password      | -u user -p pass
	] mk_visible           | make a thread/post visible | -i id [-p post?]
	^----------------------------------------------------------------------

	Other scripts, for grabbing database information etc.

	.______________________________________________________________________
	| cargo run --bin {}   | description                | options
	=----------------------=----------------------------=------------------
	] get_user             | get a user's internal info | -u user
	] dump_boards          | dump all board information | [-t] [-p] 
	] dump_admins          | display the names of admins|
	^----------------------------------------------------------------------

BACKEND STACK

	===============================
	| lang  | rust
	| http  | axum
	| db    | sqlite(rusqlite)
	| async | tokio
	===============================

DIRECTORY

	._____________________________________________________________________________________________
	| dir/file           | description
	=--------------------=------------------------------------------------------------------------
	] src/               | rust library files & main.rs
	]   routes/          | http routes passed to axum Router
	]     act.rs         | database "actions"
	]     admin.rs       | admin actions
	]     dbg.rs         | /dbg/ -- debug paths
	]     b.rs           | /b/ -- view boards
	]     t.rs           | /t/ -- view threads
	]     u.rs           | /u/ -- view users
	]     i.rs           | /i/ -- view images
	]   db/              | extras for the database
	]     test.rs        | database tests
	] bin/               | binaries & scripts
	] etc/               | configs & patches
	] css/               | css files
	]   themes/          | user theme variable files
	] run/               | runtime files (sqlite database files etc)
	^---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

